5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to understand our current staffing capacity and how previous training was received. I'll look into administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the actual gear and the timing of the switch. I'll check the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, plus the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the board minutes on capital and operating requests and the five years of renewal invoices. I want to see how our spending patterns have actually evolved over time.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure we have clear ownership when things go wrong and that our plans stay flexible! I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move. It would be prudent to see how our legacy systems age and how external transitions are handled.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
