11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, @Benjamin, it sounds like we've covered a lot of ground. I think our choices hit all the main points. Does anyone feel we missed something important before we move on?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
