19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall also await the results. It is often the smallest detail in the archives that reveals the most significant flaw in a strategy. I look forward to our findings.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We have a solid plan. I will wait for the results of our research so we can evaluate the vendors with a clear understanding of our internal constraints.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
