74,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. When the evidence aligns so perfectly with the requirements, further deliberation is merely a formality. My vote for Meridian Systems stands.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
